WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.245 --> 00:00:06.235
"A witch?" Rapunzel laughed.

2
00:00:06.236 --> 00:00:08.078
"Silly Papa!

3
00:00:08.079 --> 00:00:11.184
Witches only appear in fairy tales!"

4
00:00:11.185 --> 00:00:15.390
Papa shook his head. "Witches are real.

5
00:00:15.391 --> 00:00:19.261
I must tell you a story."

6
00:00:19.262 --> 00:00:23.654
Rapunzel listened as Papa began.

7
00:00:23.655 --> 00:00:26.244
"We used to live in the city.

8
00:00:26.245 --> 00:00:28.676
Mama was going to have a baby.

9
00:00:28.677 --> 00:00:31.714
But she was very sick.

10
00:00:31.715 --> 00:00:35.259
"Next door lived a witch with a big garden.

11
00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:38.077
The witch grew lots of plants.

12
00:00:38.078 --> 00:00:41.840
She made healing potions and spells.

13
00:00:41.841 --> 00:00:45.068
"One day Mama looked into the witch's garden.

14
00:00:45.069 --> 00:00:48.089
She saw fresh, green rapunzel.

15
00:00:48.090 --> 00:00:51.936
'It will make me well!' she said.

16
00:00:51.937 --> 00:00:56.392
So I went to the market for rapunzel.

17
00:00:56.393 --> 00:01:00.622
"Mama ate some and got well.

18
00:01:00.623 --> 00:01:04.246
Every day I bought her more.

19
00:01:04.247 --> 00:01:08.178
But then I couldn't find any rapunzel.

20
00:01:08.179 --> 00:01:13.029
Mama grew sicker and sicker.

21
00:01:13.030 --> 00:01:21.712
"One night I climbed into the witch's garden.

22
00:01:21.713 --> 00:01:25.257
I picked rapunzel, and the witch appeared!

23
00:01:25.258 --> 00:01:27.660
'Thief!' she cried.

24
00:01:27.661 --> 00:01:32.523
'I will turn you into a hedgehog!'

25
00:01:32.524 --> 00:01:34.749
"'Please!' I begged her.

26
00:01:34.750 --> 00:01:37.183
'My wife is going to have a baby.

27
00:01:37.184 --> 00:01:40.742
She must eat rapunzel or she will die!'

28
00:01:40.743 --> 00:01:48.838
"The witch laughed. 'Take my rapunzel.

29
00:01:48.839 --> 00:01:53.305
You can repay me later with your child.

30
00:01:53.306 --> 00:01:58.074
When the child turns ten, it will be mine!'

31
00:01:58.075 --> 00:02:03.794
'Never!' I cried and ran home.

32
00:02:03.795 --> 00:02:08.517
"But the next day, Mama grew even sicker.

33
00:02:08.518 --> 00:02:10.477
She was going to die, so—"

34
00:02:10.478 --> 00:02:14.442
"You went back to the garden!" Rapunzel said.

35
00:02:14.443 --> 00:02:18.533
Papa nodded. "The witch gave me some rapunzel.

36
00:02:18.534 --> 00:02:20.658
And Mama got better.

37
00:02:20.659 --> 00:02:23.597
We moved here to hide you, but . . ."

38
00:02:23.598 --> 00:02:29.171
Papa bit his lip. "Now you're ten."

39
00:02:29.172 --> 00:02:31.904
Rapunzel patted his arm.

40
00:02:31.905 --> 00:02:33.885
"Don't worry, Papa.

41
00:02:33.886 --> 00:02:38.221
That mean old witch probably forgot about me!"

42
00:02:38.222 --> 00:02:41.742
Just then Mama ran over.

43
00:02:41.743 --> 00:02:45.028
Her eyes were wide with fright.

44
00:02:45.029 --> 00:02:51.925
"Someone is coming—it's the witch!"

